# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, on every platform.
# Without this, Windows runners (core.autocrlf=true) check out CRLF and Prettier's
# `endOfLine: "lf"` check fails — which is exactly what broke CI on windows-latest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary (no eol munging) — none currently, but future-proof:
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
